  "releaseNotes": "Fix: 1.1.6 changed XdmElement.Empty* from properties to fields, which is a binary-breaking change — consumers compiled against 1.1.5 (e.g. PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.x) hit MissingMethodException calling get_EmptyAttributes() at runtime. 1.1.7 restores the property surface while keeping the boxing-once cache in private static readonly fields. Anyone who pinned 1.1.6 should upgrade.\n      Original 1.1.6 perf intent preserved: ImmutableArray<T>.Empty boxes once to IReadOnlyList<T> at type init rather than on every property read. Surfaced ~20% of remaining streaming-allocation churn observed downstream in PhoenixmlDb.Xslt 1.4.4.",
